{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40017","headline":"春入鲤湖 · 徐夤","name":"春入鲤湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到来峭壁白云齐，载酒春游渡九溪。\n铁嶂有楼霾欲堕，石门无锁路还迷。\n湖头鲤去轰雷在，树杪猨啼落日低。\n回首浮生真幻梦，何如斯地傍幽栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}